{"id":"87d9e71ea0e36b5b","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-gl-model-size.md","title":"GL Model Size","display":"df-gl-model-size — GL Model Size","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-gl-model-size","aliases":["89-df-gl-model-size"],"display":"df-gl-model-size — GL Model Size","depends_on":["[[89-df-kripke-model]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-gl-model-size"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-gl-model-size</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-gl-model-size — GL Model Size"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ab746eb779e20ce0\" href=\"?note=ab746eb779e20ce0\" title=\"89-df-kripke-model\">89-df-kripke-model</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(W_{M},R_{M},V_{M})\">\\(M=(W_{M},R_{M},V_{M})\\)</span> is a Kripke model.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}model\\text{-}size}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{size}(M)\n\\coloneqq\n|W_{M}|.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}model\\text{-}size}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{size}(M)\n\\coloneqq\n|W_{M}|.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>For finite models, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{size}(M)\\in\\mathbb{N}\">\\(\\mathrm{size}(M)\\in\\mathbb{N}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>For infinite models, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{size}(M)\">\\(\\mathrm{size}(M)\\)</span> is the actual cardinal\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|W_M|\">\\(|W_M|\\)</span>, not a single undifferentiated symbol <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\infty\">\\(\\infty\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Bounds relating <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{size}(M)\">\\(\\mathrm{size}(M)\\)</span> to a formula belong to finite-model theorems.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-kripke-model","status":"resolved","id":"ab746eb779e20ce0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-kripke-model]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M=(W_{M},R_{M},V_{M})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}model\\text{-}size}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{size}(M)\n\\coloneqq\n|W_{M}|.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{size}(M)\\in\\mathbb{N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{size}(M)","display":false},{"tex":"|W_M|","display":false},{"tex":"\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{size}(M)","display":false}],"bytes":711,"backlinks":[{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-252","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-model-size]]"}],"outgoing":["ab746eb779e20ce0"]}